boethius-foreknowledge.logic.r1: argue/scope: P1 (S2): read with the necessity on its consequent alone, foresees ∧ infallible → □foreseen_happens, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, □(foresees ∧ infallible → foreseen_happens), C1 (S3) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
